WEBVTT

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.360
"Kodomo no Odocha"

00:00:11.530 --> 00:00:13.700
That rumor that I love you

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:17.330
is true, yes it is.

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:20.830
You can't ignore it either.

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:25.420
Whether you're awake or asleep,

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:29.050
please don't be embarrassed.

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:36.640
Is it a sin if I sneak into your heart

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:40.310
by ridding you...

00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:43.480
...of your other love?

00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:48.060
At sunset,

00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:50.610
when the children go home,

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:54.530
Today's incident is burning love!

00:00:54.650 --> 00:00:58.410
You can tell it accurately.

00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:00.490
7 O'Clock News!

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:04.290
Please, our relationship...

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:09.960
Please don't blame it on the true kiss

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:11.800
In a city without light,

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:15.680
let's burn the fire of love.

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:19.100
Don't be so easy going

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:21.350
The existence is a mistake

00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:24.850
You're asking for something not there.

00:01:33.030 --> 00:01:36.780
I'm Kurata Sana, age 11.
I'm a sixth grader,

00:01:36.780 --> 00:01:38.360
who's also a TV personality,
and in Gekidan Komawari.

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:40.990
Sagami Rei-kun. He's hath
my chauffeur and my manager,

00:01:41.030 --> 00:01:43.370
as well as my boyfriend and pimp!

00:01:43.370 --> 00:01:46.330
Mama. She's an Aoki Laureate novelist
who keeps a chipmunk on her head.

00:01:46.330 --> 00:01:47.330
Hey, out of the way.

00:01:47.370 --> 00:01:48.710
How come?

00:01:48.710 --> 00:01:53.090
And this is the obstacle to me having an
enjoyable life as a student, Hayama Akito!

00:01:54.050 --> 00:01:56.550
After Hayama carried out a
great many unforgivable acts,

00:01:56.550 --> 00:01:59.010
Sana-chan finally displayed
her iron fist of fury!

00:01:59.010 --> 00:02:00.010
I win!

00:02:00.010 --> 00:02:01.010
I lose!

00:02:01.050 --> 00:02:01.970
I win!

00:02:01.970 --> 00:02:03.970
I lose! But in the end,

00:02:03.970 --> 00:02:06.890
I finally got him where he's vulnerable!

00:02:08.310 --> 00:02:11.980
I'm sorry. I won't do it any more.

00:02:11.980 --> 00:02:15.190
I did it! Take that!

00:02:16.320 --> 00:02:17.820
Mother...?

00:02:21.320 --> 00:02:25.700
Stop badmouthing my mother!!

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:31.330
What's so wrong about loving
your own mother!? Eh!?

00:02:31.330 --> 00:02:34.000
You do have some good points too,
huh Hayama?

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:35.670
Huh?

00:02:35.670 --> 00:02:39.260
Hayama didn't have a mother
in his household, did he?

00:02:39.260 --> 00:02:41.260
There must be something going an there.

00:02:44.350 --> 00:02:51.060
"Naughty Hayama, Where Are You Going?"

00:02:51.100 --> 00:02:53.060
"Morning with Hayama and Tsuyoshi-kun"

00:02:57.740 --> 00:02:59.740
Akito-kun, good morning!

00:02:59.740 --> 00:03:00.410
Yeah.

00:03:00.410 --> 00:03:01.740
You sure are early, huh?

00:03:01.740 --> 00:03:02.870
Yeah.

00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:14.040
There's something nice about
getting up early, isn't there?

00:03:18.840 --> 00:03:21.090
"However, as for Sana-chan"

00:03:23.430 --> 00:03:25.430
Thank you, Rei-kun! I love you!

00:03:25.430 --> 00:03:26.430
See you later, Sana-chan.

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:28.430
Off I go!

00:03:28.430 --> 00:03:31.350
Why does this always happen,
every single day?

00:03:31.350 --> 00:03:32.690
It's because you don't
get up early enough.

00:03:32.690 --> 00:03:36.320
Wait! Wait! Wait!
Chime, don't stop ringing yet!

00:03:36.320 --> 00:03:38.280
"6th Grade, 3rd Class"

00:03:36.320 --> 00:03:38.280
Do you suppose Sana-chan
isn't coming today?

00:03:38.360 --> 00:03:40.700
It's too soon to tell.

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:42.700
There. Here she is.

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:43.700
Morning!

00:03:43.700 --> 00:03:45.660
--Morning, Sana-chan.
--Morning, Sana-chan.

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:51.710
--Good morning.
--Good morning.
--Good morning.

00:03:51.710 --> 00:03:54.040
Good morning.

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:57.380
Thank you, God.

00:03:57.380 --> 00:04:00.050
Okay then, please open to
page 48 in the textbook.

00:04:00.050 --> 00:04:03.050
Peaceful, peaceful... but still...

00:04:03.050 --> 00:04:05.050
There's something weird here...

00:04:05.050 --> 00:04:06.930
"Let's all go see!"

00:04:07.050 --> 00:04:10.060
Hey! Have you seen the
new teacher 1st Class has?

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:12.390
She's ghastly ugly!

00:04:12.390 --> 00:04:15.730
--Ghastly ugly?
--How bad could she be?

00:04:15.730 --> 00:04:17.060
Ghastly?

00:04:17.060 --> 00:04:18.070
Ghastly!

00:04:18.070 --> 00:04:20.400
Yeah! Let's go see!

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:22.240
All right, this way!

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:31.080
Hayama-san, do you want to go see, too?

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:33.040
No, I'm fine.

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:34.040
Let's go!

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:35.330
Ghastly!

00:04:35.370 --> 00:04:37.250
I think I'll go, too.

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:39.380
Good grief!

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:41.340
Those boys really get my goat!

00:04:41.340 --> 00:04:44.720
Where do they get off calling other
people ugly with the faces they've got?

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:47.390
Then again, you've got to
give Hayama-kun some credit.

00:04:47.390 --> 00:04:50.220
He might already understand
when it comes to that sort of thing.

00:04:50.220 --> 00:04:52.430
Don't you think so, Sana-chan?

00:04:53.730 --> 00:04:56.850
Right, right, right! Discriminating,
I guess you'd call him.

00:04:56.850 --> 00:05:00.110
It makes me think he's
not all that bad a guy.

00:05:01.690 --> 00:05:03.360
Gleam!

00:05:03.360 --> 00:05:07.410
Boss, I'm not sure why, but they're
speaking well of you over there.

00:05:07.410 --> 00:05:11.080
She really is ugly.
Akito-kun, why don't you go see?

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:13.750
I'm fine.

00:05:13.750 --> 00:05:16.040
Hayama-kun's an adult, all right!

00:05:16.040 --> 00:05:19.710
I thought he was different than before.

00:05:19.710 --> 00:05:22.340
See? See? See? They're talking highly,
they're talking highly.

00:05:23.760 --> 00:05:25.760
He really is a good person...

00:05:25.760 --> 00:05:28.430
I've already seen enough of
your ugly faces, after all.

00:05:28.430 --> 00:05:30.430
So that's how it is, huh!?

00:05:30.430 --> 00:05:31.680
--He's terrible.
--See? Ghastly ugly, right?

00:05:31.680 --> 00:05:33.350
--I don't know...
--Ah, you're turning red!

00:05:33.350 --> 00:05:34.350
What is it with him?

00:05:34.350 --> 00:05:35.350
Eh? Is she your type?

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:37.020
Hayama's a dummy.

00:05:37.020 --> 00:05:39.360
He's terrible.

00:05:39.360 --> 00:05:41.690
Maybe the photo is working too well...

00:05:41.690 --> 00:05:43.610
"Hayama, all alone"

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:49.370
Hayama!

00:05:49.370 --> 00:05:50.370
What are you doing?

00:05:50.370 --> 00:05:52.740
Listen, listen, listen,
you've gotten so carried away,

00:05:52.740 --> 00:05:55.040
you weren't able to suddenly
stop before, haven't you?

00:05:55.040 --> 00:05:57.710
Huh? Is there something you need?

00:05:57.710 --> 00:06:00.920
You're scared, aren't you? "Stripped!"

00:06:03.380 --> 00:06:07.300
That's all right. As long as you
don't run wild in the classroom

00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:10.050
or pester the teachers,
I won't show everybody!

00:06:10.050 --> 00:06:11.680
As long as you play
nicely with everyone,

00:06:11.680 --> 00:06:14.720
everything is completely okay,
and naturally daff-ay.

00:06:14.720 --> 00:06:18.060
Don't you worry about it. Hayama!

00:06:18.060 --> 00:06:19.400
You're not listening
to me at all, are you?

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:20.400
Join me?

00:06:20.400 --> 00:06:21.730
Where?

00:06:23.730 --> 00:06:26.110
--Dummy! Dummy! Dummy! Dummy!
--Sana-chan is facing the boy's restroom

00:06:26.110 --> 00:06:29.910
--Dummy! Dummy! Du-mmy!
--and saying "dummy, dummy."

00:06:31.320 --> 00:06:33.660
Ah, what are you kicking it there for!?

00:06:33.660 --> 00:06:35.580
There it goes!

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:46.340
Uh, Hayama-san, we're short one person.
Want to play soccer with us?

00:06:49.340 --> 00:06:51.300
What was that for!?

00:06:52.850 --> 00:06:54.680
Ah, hey! Are you ignoring me again!?

00:06:54.680 --> 00:06:58.770
Hey, Hayama! Bring those
grumpies over here!

00:06:58.770 --> 00:07:00.690
Come on, come on, stop ignoring me!

00:07:00.690 --> 00:07:02.690
Why don't you play soccer with everyone,

00:07:02.690 --> 00:07:04.900
and enjoy yourself once in a while?

00:07:06.030 --> 00:07:08.360
What is it? What are you trying to say?

00:07:08.360 --> 00:07:11.610
You should have just been good and listened
to me like this in the first place.

00:07:11.610 --> 00:07:14.030
Being good is the best!
Let me handle this.

00:07:14.030 --> 00:07:16.040
Hey, you guys!

00:07:16.040 --> 00:07:18.700
Would you let this guy
play soccer with you?

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:21.500
Kurata, if you're going
to bring us someone,

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:23.040
make it somebody who can
actually play soccer.

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:26.050
What are you talking about? Of course
he can play. It's Hayama, after all...

00:07:26.050 --> 00:07:28.050
It's... not Hayama...

00:07:28.090 --> 00:07:30.090
"Sana doesn't give up"

00:07:30.380 --> 00:07:32.010
Nyaah!

00:07:32.010 --> 00:07:33.590
What do you want?

00:07:33.590 --> 00:07:37.350
Stop goofing around here, get to your
Komawari circle, and start circling.

00:07:37.350 --> 00:07:39.930
Grrr! Komawari is
on Saturday and Sunday!

00:07:39.930 --> 00:07:42.020
Besides, this is about
a different matter.

00:07:42.020 --> 00:07:43.690
As such...

00:07:43.690 --> 00:07:46.400
Ever since you gave up being the
monkey leader, you've always been alone,

00:07:46.400 --> 00:07:48.990
haven't you? That's strange.

00:07:50.360 --> 00:07:53.490
Whether I'm alone or not
has nothing to do with you.

00:07:54.700 --> 00:07:58.040
You've got something
that's troubling you, right?

00:07:58.040 --> 00:08:01.710
So now you're my counselor?
That's a lot of trouble you're going to.

00:08:01.710 --> 00:08:03.370
Oh, I never!

00:08:03.370 --> 00:08:05.840
You are such a thoroughly
aggravating fellow!

00:08:07.040 --> 00:08:09.880
I'll return that sentiment
right back at you.

00:08:10.720 --> 00:08:13.720
Oh, no! I can't let myself
play into his hand...

00:08:13.720 --> 00:08:17.390
Now, don't go turning on me like that,
just listen to what I have to say, Peggy.

00:08:17.390 --> 00:08:18.720
Who are you calling Peggy?

00:08:18.720 --> 00:08:21.060
You know what? I enjoy every day.

00:08:21.060 --> 00:08:22.060
I'll bet.

00:08:22.060 --> 00:08:26.060
It's like, every year,
I make more and more friends.

00:08:26.110 --> 00:08:29.730
And then I think about
what tomorrow holds in store.

00:08:29.730 --> 00:08:31.990
You know? Don't you think that's fun?

00:08:31.990 --> 00:08:33.070
Not in the least.

00:08:34.990 --> 00:08:38.330
Why do you have to be so negative?

00:08:38.330 --> 00:08:43.000
When I see someone as gloomy
as you are, it makes me sad, too.

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:45.210
If there's something that's
causing you to be so gloomy,

00:08:45.210 --> 00:08:48.340
let's do something about it,
and make things more pleasant.

00:08:48.340 --> 00:08:49.340
Some cause?

00:08:49.340 --> 00:08:53.420
You know? I want us all to be more
cheerful and agreeable with each other!

00:08:53.420 --> 00:08:54.340
Let's go all-out!

00:08:54.340 --> 00:08:57.010
If there's anything I can do
to help, would you tell me?

00:08:57.010 --> 00:08:59.640
If there's anything
I can do, I'll do it!

00:08:59.640 --> 00:09:01.970
We can flush everything else that's
happened up to now down the toilet!

00:09:03.350 --> 00:09:04.640
Anything?

00:09:07.350 --> 00:09:08.690
Mm-hmm.

00:09:08.690 --> 00:09:10.730
Well then, kill me.

00:09:12.360 --> 00:09:17.030
K- ki- ki-- eh...?

00:09:17.030 --> 00:09:21.700
W- w- w- why do you
have to be like that!?

00:09:21.700 --> 00:09:24.830
How come you're always saying
such miserable things!?

00:09:24.830 --> 00:09:27.040
Geez, and here I am, going
to all this trouble... sheesh!

00:09:27.040 --> 00:09:28.040
Can't you do it?

00:09:28.040 --> 00:09:31.340
You know there's no way I can do that!
Why would you even say such a thing!?

00:09:31.340 --> 00:09:34.510
I said it because you
told me you would help me.

00:09:35.300 --> 00:09:39.970
Uh, no... I don't care anymore. If you
want to die, you can just do it yourself.

00:09:39.970 --> 00:09:41.560
I won't stop you.

00:09:41.560 --> 00:09:44.350
Go ahead and smash your head in with
the edge of a block of tofu or something!

00:09:44.350 --> 00:09:45.890
Do it.

00:09:46.690 --> 00:09:51.360
You're... you're walking around
with one of these!? How dangerous!

00:09:51.360 --> 00:09:54.030
Haven't you ever thought
that you wanted to die?

00:09:54.030 --> 00:09:55.650
Never!

00:09:55.690 --> 00:09:59.320
I'd guess not. You and I
are just too different.

00:09:59.370 --> 00:10:02.370
It's no use for us to try
talking about it, is it?

00:10:02.370 --> 00:10:06.040
You think that your way of thinking
is the only right way, don't you?

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:09.000
Well, don't force it on me,
it's annoying!

00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:12.420
You go ahead and enjoy yourself.
You don't know anything,

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:14.050
so don't go sticking your nose
into other people's business!

00:10:14.050 --> 00:10:17.260
You couldn't understand the way I feel!

00:10:23.680 --> 00:10:27.730
You're right. I don't understand
the way you think at all.

00:10:27.730 --> 00:10:31.020
That's why I want to learn--
why I said I want to help.

00:10:31.020 --> 00:10:33.070
How could you want to die...?

00:10:39.990 --> 00:10:41.490
Never mind!

00:10:47.660 --> 00:10:49.370
I'm home!

00:10:56.340 --> 00:11:00.760
That dummy! Hayama, you big dummy!
You grouch!

00:11:08.020 --> 00:11:09.480
Rei-kun!

00:11:11.690 --> 00:11:14.690
Rei-kun, did you spill some coffee?

00:11:14.690 --> 00:11:15.980
A little.

00:12:02.080 --> 00:12:04.080
Ah, Mama! Good morning!

00:12:05.080 --> 00:12:07.750
What? What? What is this?
What's the matter? What happened?

00:12:07.750 --> 00:12:09.750
--Ah, this is unusual.
--Sana, tell Mama what's going on.

00:12:09.750 --> 00:12:10.750
--Mama, you're all flustered.
--This is too strange!

00:12:10.750 --> 00:12:14.420
Sana, are you sure you're
not feeling out of sorts?

00:12:14.420 --> 00:12:17.760
Not really. I just woke up spontaneously.

00:12:17.760 --> 00:12:20.100
That's absolutely positively strange.

00:12:20.100 --> 00:12:21.760
--Good morning.
--Morning.

00:12:21.770 --> 00:12:24.770
--Morning, Sana-chan.
--Yay! Rei-kun, good morning!

00:12:24.770 --> 00:12:27.100
Sana-chan, that's an unusual
getup you're wearing.

00:12:27.100 --> 00:12:30.770
I'm sorry about yesterday.
I didn't mean to make you worry.

00:12:30.770 --> 00:12:32.780
Good, it looks like you've cheered up.

00:12:32.780 --> 00:12:37.780
I sure am! Cheery, cheery, monkey,
monkey, ookie, lucky! Rei-kun...

00:12:38.050 --> 00:12:41.460
There's nothing really going on
between me and Hayama, so don't worry.

00:12:42.390 --> 00:12:43.390
All right.

00:12:43.390 --> 00:12:46.720
I don't know the first thing
about what's going on!

00:12:46.720 --> 00:12:50.060
But never mind that--
Sana, why are you wearing an apron?

00:12:50.060 --> 00:12:52.130
Right, right, that's right!

00:12:52.130 --> 00:12:57.070
It's because I'm going to make breakfast
for my beloved Mama and Rei-kun!

00:12:57.070 --> 00:12:58.070
You're what!?

00:12:58.070 --> 00:13:00.880
You'd better sit down for this! Ta-da!

00:13:01.740 --> 00:13:04.070
--They're empty...
--It's coming up next, right?

00:13:04.070 --> 00:13:08.080
American breakfast! Corn flakes!

00:13:08.080 --> 00:13:10.550
You pour the corn flakes into a mortar,

00:13:10.550 --> 00:13:12.880
then grind, grind, grind,
grind, grind, grind,

00:13:12.880 --> 00:13:14.750
and when it's pulverized,
you add milk.

00:13:14.750 --> 00:13:17.360
There. All done!

00:13:18.420 --> 00:13:20.420
Oh, this sure looks easy to digest, huh?

00:13:20.420 --> 00:13:22.760
Okay! Rei-kun, you get an extra scoop!

00:13:22.760 --> 00:13:23.760
Thanks.

00:13:23.760 --> 00:13:28.760
So wild, yet so easy!
It's nutritious, and very American!

00:13:28.770 --> 00:13:30.770
But aren't you short on sleep?

00:13:30.770 --> 00:13:32.770
And now, this week's Sana-chan.

00:13:32.770 --> 00:13:35.150
Apron Sana-chan. This is unusual!

00:13:36.370 --> 00:13:39.040
Let's see, yesterday we started
from page 48 in the text, right?

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:40.380
I've got nothing to do with you!

00:13:40.380 --> 00:13:43.480
--I'm not going to worry
about you any more!
--Actually, Sensei messed up.

00:13:43.480 --> 00:13:45.220
Today, we'll start on page 46.

00:14:08.070 --> 00:14:09.710
That was a close one...

00:14:36.370 --> 00:14:38.710
No! Watch out!

00:14:40.040 --> 00:14:41.640
Don't do it!

00:14:49.050 --> 00:14:50.710
Sana-chan...?

00:14:50.710 --> 00:14:52.380
What are you so distant about?

00:14:52.380 --> 00:14:54.050
Are you all right?

00:14:54.050 --> 00:14:55.550
I'm okay.

00:14:56.720 --> 00:14:58.720
Are you having a hard time at work?

00:14:58.720 --> 00:15:00.060
It's fine.

00:15:23.410 --> 00:15:24.760
Don't do it!

00:15:26.080 --> 00:15:28.080
What's this about?

00:15:28.080 --> 00:15:28.750
Sana-chan...?

00:15:28.750 --> 00:15:30.090
Let's go home.

00:15:30.090 --> 00:15:31.420
Hayama!

00:15:31.420 --> 00:15:32.750
What?

00:15:32.760 --> 00:15:35.360
Uh, nothing, never mind.

00:15:35.360 --> 00:15:38.360
Ah, I've had enough. I've really
had enough. This is all his fault.

00:15:38.360 --> 00:15:40.330
"Feeling out of sorts, Sana is troubled"

00:15:40.360 --> 00:15:45.360
Okay, twist hard at the waist.
One, two, three, four...

00:15:46.040 --> 00:15:50.370
--Really, what is it with him?
--Again, one, two, three, four...

00:15:50.370 --> 00:15:53.710
--I thought all this time about
why I teared up yesterday...
--Ah, you there, a little tighter, now.

00:15:53.710 --> 00:15:54.710
Here we go again.

00:15:54.710 --> 00:15:57.910
You think that your way of thinking
is the only right way, don't you?

00:15:57.910 --> 00:16:00.720
Well, don't force it on me,
it's annoying!

00:16:00.720 --> 00:16:02.820
It's because there I was,
100% concerned about Hayama,

00:16:02.820 --> 00:16:04.050
asking about him with good intentions,

00:16:04.050 --> 00:16:07.390
and he tossed it back in
my face as hard as he could.

00:16:07.390 --> 00:16:10.730
You couldn't understand the way I feel!

00:16:10.730 --> 00:16:13.730
That was the first time
anyone has ever told me that.

00:16:15.730 --> 00:16:17.730
Sana-chan!

00:16:17.730 --> 00:16:19.740
Are you okay?

00:16:19.740 --> 00:16:24.740
W- what is it with him!? I can't
shake it off. It feels disgusting!

00:16:24.740 --> 00:16:26.650
"The people in Hayama's family"

00:16:27.080 --> 00:16:28.610
Work, work!

00:16:28.610 --> 00:16:30.750
All the other kids have already finished
their parent-teacher conferences!

00:16:30.750 --> 00:16:33.320
I'm the only one in my class that hasn't!

00:16:34.680 --> 00:16:37.690
All the others' parents have come, I said!
This is my last year of middle school!

00:16:37.690 --> 00:16:39.190
I'm preparing to take entrance exams!

00:16:39.190 --> 00:16:42.860
You could at least take off half a day
from work, couldn't you, Father!?

00:16:48.700 --> 00:16:50.370
This is your fault, Akito!

00:16:50.370 --> 00:16:52.680
Everything is your fault!

00:16:57.370 --> 00:16:59.940
Sana-chan, I und-uh-stand you've got
the lead role in an upcoming drawma.

00:16:59.940 --> 00:17:00.710
What kind of role is it?

00:17:00.710 --> 00:17:05.050
No, I don't. I'm not in the lead role,
I'm, um, the lead role's sister.

00:17:05.050 --> 00:17:06.720
Ah, so this is a story about sist-uhs?

00:17:06.720 --> 00:17:08.420
Um, no.

00:17:08.420 --> 00:17:11.390
--I guess I'll just have to pluck this
drama while I explain this to you all.
--You mean "plug," not "pluck."

00:17:11.390 --> 00:17:13.720
Oh? Let's hea-uh awl about it then.

00:17:13.720 --> 00:17:17.730
Mm-hmm, anyways, because of me,
my mother has been ill for a long time,

00:17:17.730 --> 00:17:19.900
and my sister, the lead character,
has had a lot of trouble.

00:17:19.900 --> 00:17:20.730
But I'm a good kid, and all.

00:17:20.730 --> 00:17:24.130
What was that? Who's the lead charact-uh,
and who was sick again?

00:17:24.130 --> 00:17:26.740
I'm a little confused.
Could'ja explain it again?

00:17:26.740 --> 00:17:29.470
Okay, now, I've been the mother
for a long time,

00:17:29.470 --> 00:17:30.740
and the lead character,
Sick, is my sister...

00:17:30.740 --> 00:17:33.410
You're wrong! That's not what
you said before, Sana-chan.

00:17:33.410 --> 00:17:35.010
What did I say?

00:17:35.010 --> 00:17:37.350
I'm not getting this at awl.
Maybe I shouldn't have asked.

00:17:37.350 --> 00:17:39.680
But anyhow, everyone around me
will be a real actor.

00:17:39.680 --> 00:17:43.020
I'm sure it won't be as much fun
as doing "Child's Toy."

00:17:43.020 --> 00:17:45.250
And when I think about
how they'll tease me,

00:17:45.250 --> 00:17:48.020
saying "You're too sassy,"
or crack the whip on me behind the set,

00:17:48.020 --> 00:17:52.360
I get more and more nervous
about being in it.

00:17:52.360 --> 00:17:54.030
Kurata Sana is a little blue...

00:17:54.030 --> 00:17:57.030
Sana-chan, you seem to be acting
a bit out of charact-uh today.

00:17:57.030 --> 00:17:59.370
So then, let's get going
with our hour here!

00:17:59.370 --> 00:18:01.940
Now, you're not the teach-uh,
how come you're running things?

00:18:06.040 --> 00:18:09.380
That's Zenjiro-chan's autograph, right?
Is that a present for someone?

00:18:09.380 --> 00:18:12.210
Mm-hmm. All right, it's been bugging me
so much thinking about this,

00:18:12.220 --> 00:18:13.720
I'd hate to actually turn into a bug.

00:18:13.720 --> 00:18:17.050
Ew, I wish I hadn't said that!
Rei-kun, let's go!

00:18:17.050 --> 00:18:18.050
Huh? Where?

00:18:18.050 --> 00:18:19.730
To go deliver this!

00:18:22.060 --> 00:18:25.100
Hey, there, how is the grouch today?

00:18:30.730 --> 00:18:35.000
I brought the autograph your sister
wanted from Zenjiro-san. See? See?

00:18:35.000 --> 00:18:37.670
Can I come in? Oh, I'm in, huh?

00:18:37.670 --> 00:18:39.010
--Sorry to intrude!
--J- just a minute, now!

00:18:39.010 --> 00:18:41.310
Look, look, this is freshly autographed!

00:18:41.310 --> 00:18:42.940
--He was good enough to sign it for her.
--H- hold on...!

00:18:42.950 --> 00:18:44.680
Zenjiro-san is a nice man, you know.

00:18:44.680 --> 00:18:46.680
Oh, I guess it doesn't do any good
to show you the back of it.

00:18:46.680 --> 00:18:48.020
I'll give it to her.

00:18:48.020 --> 00:18:51.020
No way. Your sister asked me, after all.

00:18:51.020 --> 00:18:53.690
--Your sister is here, right?
--H- hold on a minute...

00:18:53.690 --> 00:18:58.360
It's okay, it's okay! "No Professional!"
I mean, "No Program!"

00:18:58.360 --> 00:18:59.690
Huh?

00:18:59.700 --> 00:19:01.030
Well, that's okay, right? Excuse me--!

00:19:01.030 --> 00:19:02.700
No!

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:05.270
Wait here! Stay back!

00:19:07.370 --> 00:19:09.040
Cut it out, already!

00:19:09.040 --> 00:19:12.040
You burned the curry, you know!
I told you to keep an eye on the flame!

00:19:12.040 --> 00:19:14.040
I can't help it if it burned!

00:19:14.040 --> 00:19:15.040
You did it on purpose, didn't you!?

00:19:15.040 --> 00:19:16.040
No I didn't.

00:19:16.050 --> 00:19:18.010
I can't even study
for my entrance exams.

00:19:18.010 --> 00:19:20.380
If I don't get into high school,
it'll be your fault!

00:19:20.380 --> 00:19:21.720
How come?

00:19:21.720 --> 00:19:24.720
It'll be your fault, Akito!
Everything is all your fault!

00:19:24.720 --> 00:19:27.060
You're the one who killed Mother,
after all!

00:19:27.060 --> 00:19:28.390
You're the devil!

00:19:28.390 --> 00:19:30.000
You're a devil child!

00:19:33.060 --> 00:19:35.000
Oh dear, Sana-chan, you're here?

00:19:35.000 --> 00:19:36.670
Uh... um, here...

00:19:36.670 --> 00:19:40.240
Gracious, how embarrassing
for you to see us like this.

00:19:44.670 --> 00:19:47.010
Hayama...

00:19:47.010 --> 00:19:48.390
you...

00:19:50.010 --> 00:19:54.260
My mother... died as a
result of giving birth to me.

00:19:56.350 --> 00:19:58.690
S- so that's why...?

00:19:58.690 --> 00:20:03.020
Because of that, it's always
been like this for you at home?

00:20:03.030 --> 00:20:05.030
For eleven whole years?

00:20:05.030 --> 00:20:10.770
Your home is abnormal. I hate
to say it, but that's abnormal.

00:20:12.370 --> 00:20:17.040
Your mother gave all that she had
to give birth to you, didn't she?

00:20:17.040 --> 00:20:19.520
It can't go on like this, Hayama.

00:20:29.720 --> 00:20:31.050
Hayama!

00:20:31.050 --> 00:20:34.660
I'll do my best in this drama!

00:20:34.660 --> 00:20:38.000
So you do your best, too! See ya!

00:20:43.670 --> 00:20:46.330
I don't get her.

00:20:46.340 --> 00:20:48.340
Sana-chan!

00:20:48.340 --> 00:20:49.980
Up here, up here!

00:20:51.010 --> 00:20:55.010
Sorry about that. Thanks for
Zenjiro-chan's autograph.

00:20:55.010 --> 00:20:57.010
No, no, not at all.

00:20:57.010 --> 00:20:58.990
Okay, see you later.

00:21:02.890 --> 00:21:03.960
Okay...

00:21:04.690 --> 00:21:07.020
She's a regular person.

00:21:07.070 --> 00:21:10.910
"Rei-kun is waiting"

00:21:08.360 --> 00:21:10.700
♪ Glas-sun, glas-sun, sunglasses. ♪

00:21:11.360 --> 00:21:13.360
♪ I am Rei-kun, waiting in the car. ♪

00:21:13.360 --> 00:21:15.700
♪ Waiting here until
Sana-chan comes back. ♪

00:21:15.700 --> 00:21:18.030
♪ I can't take my glas-sun off outside. ♪

00:21:18.030 --> 00:21:20.370
♪ Sana-chan said so,
so I don't take them off. ♪

00:21:20.370 --> 00:21:22.700
♪ When nighttime comes,
it's dark all around, ♪

00:21:22.710 --> 00:21:25.040
♪ and with my glans-sun on,
it's totally dark! ♪

00:21:25.040 --> 00:21:27.040
♪ But even so,
Rei-kun remains undaunted. ♪

00:21:27.040 --> 00:21:28.480
--♪ Up in the sky ♪
--♪ Up in the sky ♪

00:21:28.480 --> 00:21:29.620
--♪ the stars are twinkling. ♪
--♪ the stars are twinkling. ♪

00:21:34.720 --> 00:21:36.660
Sana-chan, job well done.

00:21:38.050 --> 00:21:39.530
Rei-kun...

00:21:41.860 --> 00:21:44.060
I'm going to do my best in this drama.

00:21:44.060 --> 00:21:47.400
What's this, suddenly? I thought
you weren't very enthused about it.

00:21:47.400 --> 00:21:50.130
You're right! This drama
has some depressing themes,

00:21:50.130 --> 00:21:53.070
and I wasn't very enthusiastic
about doing it.

00:21:53.070 --> 00:21:54.640
But it turns out that the
setting for this drama

00:21:54.640 --> 00:21:56.400
is a dead ringer for Hayama's home.

00:21:56.410 --> 00:21:58.070
A red dinger!

00:21:58.070 --> 00:22:00.740
The drama may be depressing,
but it has a happy end.

00:22:00.740 --> 00:22:03.410
I'm going to do my best, and I'm going
to have Hayama's family watch it,

00:22:03.410 --> 00:22:06.190
and Hayama's family will have
a happy end, too! That's it!

00:22:08.020 --> 00:22:09.020
Sana-chan...

00:22:09.020 --> 00:22:12.350
Maybe I'm shameless,
and maybe I'm a buttinski,

00:22:12.350 --> 00:22:13.460
but I can't leave this alone.

00:22:16.690 --> 00:22:21.030
Just you wait, Hayama.
Someday, I'm sure to make you smile wide!

00:22:21.030 --> 00:22:24.740
You'll be saying "Being alive is
so much fun, I can't stand it!"

00:22:27.040 --> 00:22:29.640
Rei-kun, this is going
to go over well for sure!

00:22:33.300 --> 00:22:34.220
I know.

00:22:38.050 --> 00:22:39.620
All right!

00:22:40.670 --> 00:22:42.170
"Back against the wall."

00:22:42.670 --> 00:22:47.670
That's what you say about times like these.

00:22:48.930 --> 00:22:52.390
In dire straits,

00:22:53.140 --> 00:22:55.970
I've been waiting for an answer.

00:22:56.470 --> 00:22:59.850
My confessions are worked out
long in advance,

00:23:00.810 --> 00:23:04.940
to always go along with the scenario.

00:23:05.150 --> 00:23:10.990
My heart may be settled, but my mind is in a...

00:23:11.240 --> 00:23:13.200
...panic!!

00:23:14.240 --> 00:23:19.040
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:19.250 --> 00:23:21.750
he's there.

00:23:22.670 --> 00:23:25.000
And our usual classroom...

00:23:25.210 --> 00:23:27.590
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:23:27.710 --> 00:23:30.090
...for two.

00:23:30.930 --> 00:23:33.550
Although I've said nothing but wisecracks...

00:23:33.760 --> 00:23:38.310
...up to now, just for today,

00:23:39.230 --> 00:23:41.900
I'm going to be honest and sincere,

00:23:42.100 --> 00:23:46.610
so BOY, take a look my way!

00:23:47.530 --> 00:23:52.200
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:52.360 --> 00:23:54.870
he's there,

00:23:55.830 --> 00:23:58.040
And our usual classroom...

00:23:58.290 --> 00:24:00.620
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:24:00.750 --> 00:24:03.120
...for two.

00:24:07.170 --> 00:24:09.800
Hoy! In Sana-chan's next adventures...

00:24:09.800 --> 00:24:13.300
Okay, the taping for the drama
has begun, and I'm giving my best!

00:24:13.300 --> 00:24:16.470
I'm going to show that backward,
idiotic father and daughter!

00:24:16.470 --> 00:24:17.310
On the night of the broadcast,

00:24:17.310 --> 00:24:20.140
how come neither Hayama nor
Hayama's father are around!?

00:24:20.140 --> 00:24:24.150
Hayama, where are you hiding yourself!?
My drama is about to start!

00:24:24.150 --> 00:24:26.480
Watch it, watch it, I'm begging you!

00:24:26.480 --> 00:24:29.530
Next time on Kodomo no Omocha,
Episode 5 of the Laughter,
Tears, and Fireballs Saga:

00:24:29.530 --> 00:24:32.490
"Chicken-and-Egg Dum-Dum,
Too Yucky to Eat"

00:24:32.490 --> 00:24:35.200
Unexpectedly tearing up?
Trickle, trickle...
